Package: bartcommute
Title: Plan BART Commutes to Downtown Berkeley
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Tsion-Aduesa", "Smart", , "tazismart@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Wraps the BART (Bay Area Rapid Transit) API to list stations
    and plan trips that arrive by a given time, returning tidy data frames
    of departure and arrival times, trip length, Clipper fare, and
    transfers. Includes a data set of commutes from every station to
    Downtown Berkeley.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1.0)
LazyData: true
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Imports: 
    httr2,
    lubridate,
    tibble
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
